  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Yh63Zk81\">针对营销数据获取，本篇为大家提供了两种切实可行的数据推送方案，帮助大家高效、稳定、近实时地获取数据，更好地运用数据给营销投放提效。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-M8Gf94PS\" id=\"link-0\">SPI</h2><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-Qf6mT84C\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G9zEIUbo\">开发者需要先在开发者管理后台<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/subscription\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">创建订阅任务</a>，当订阅的内容发生变动时，<strong>平台会请求开发者预留的回调链接，将内容变动消息告知开发者</strong>，开发者基于收到的消息后再调用API接口获取数据，减少轮询次数。</p></blockquote><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-2Xjn73lk\" id=\"link-1\">RDS</h2><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-SYkTU0TG\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9wVnH9eA\">开发者需要先在开发者管理后台<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/rds\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">创建订阅任务</a>，当订阅的内容发生变动时，<strong>平台会实时推送数据至连山RDS进行存储</strong>，开发者可以在连山平台部署相关应用进行数据读取，无需再次调用API接口。</p></blockquote><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-TUM7PbTi\" id=\"h490b8bf-TUM7PbTi\">RDS推送、SPI推送、HTTP API拉取能力对比</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-JMOYGE8k\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-J344cY8k\"><col data-id=\"c4c6336b-QNcmbRlB\" span=\"1\" width=\"11.744583808437856%\"/><col data-id=\"c292cd49-PWgoAQPZ\" span=\"1\" width=\"36.03192702394527%\"/><col data-id=\"c2bf180f-V80jYR6Z\" span=\"1\" width=\"26.111744583808438%\"/><col data-id=\"c2bf180f-gf673ZWH\" span=\"1\" width=\"26.111744583808438%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-2gBLsh3Z\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-HoYy1BD7\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-G91AYYpO\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-REqpatvk\"><br/></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-c7tWjLU2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3hup1eGJ\"><strong>RDS推送</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ECN6eU1P\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HPkMtlCZ\"><strong>SPI推送</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-IiaNW46o\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mR6j01Wg\"><strong>API拉取</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-GGW8C3B5\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-cqQUgR9z\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DiMb130T\"><strong>效率</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-hrwVv3KW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AXp0mrpa\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>高</strong></span>：内容直接推送到RDS数据库，比SPI推送和API拉取处理链路更短，效率会更高</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-83QMUIpG\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Wldz78xO\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\"><strong>中</strong></span>：内容推送到开发者预留的回调接口</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-D1NnXERm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mr5ANg9o\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>低</strong></span>：通过接口一个个拉取，因为考虑到性能和平台稳定性，有频控限制，数据拉取效率受限</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-kt0LyUEB\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-EzOH1Sdv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lFL1fuLi\"><strong>时效性</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-8rUpHZFK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-V6sRikUH\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>高</strong></span>：推送性能完全由RDS本身决定，性能对失效性的受限较小；数据通过binlog、主动通知等方式感知数据变化，比轮询方式时效性更高</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ElWy1A4t\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uQbysfRC\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\"><strong>中</strong></span><strong> - </strong><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>高</strong></span>：如果开发者接口性能较好，时效可以跟RDS保持一致</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-40EXsD4E\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GYs7nMjx\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>低</strong></span>：因为有频控的限制，所以数据拉取频率受限，数据时效性较低</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-RvR1ja3L\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-JeL5LWE7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-29U8wn8s\"><strong>频控限制</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-1FOcvvT3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Fd3keGvA\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>受RDS数据库写入性能限制</strong></span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-lKo1SeeA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2qCTRNMy\"><span style=\"color: #6425d0;\"><strong>受开发者回调接口性能限制</strong></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-dSnJmH0v\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JAjndIuW\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>受频控等级限制</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-8zfIiORr\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-LUQQED8Z\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3Ay1xjkp\"><strong>平台稳定性</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t6488dbd-3R5oQXV1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i4Y6ILoL\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>推送速率可控，平台稳定性强</strong></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-Rlk3clnD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-klx4IFUq\">各开发者访问峰谷不完全可控，为保证平台稳定性，对访问频控有严格限制。但是在高峰期，接口超时较严重</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "订阅服务"
}
